<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-NORMA'S FEBRUARY PROFIT 7.2 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-NORMA'S FEBRUARY PROFIT 7.2 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified industrialist Norma said on Tuesday that its February net profit was 7.2 million kroons compared to January's 7.8 million kroons.</p>
<p>The company's turnover for February was 40.5 million kroons against January's 40.2 million kroons, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The year is going according to plan thanks to a good market situation and a favourable U.S. dollar exchange rate,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
